ou, but actually it doesn&#x27;t benefit nobody else. Like Craig can&#x27;t do Saturdays. I know Claire will be no Paul will be open to he&#x27;ll be totally fine. Um Sean will be Sean will he be okay with it? Young kids I can see him actually wanting to have time at the weekend to be honest. Um So you,</p><p>Karen Lochhead: What do you say me? And Paul are saddles?</p><p>Bob Duncan: Well, No, I mean you are doing it because it benefits you. Yeah, yeah. You know, you are actually in a selfish way. This is actually helping you out. It gives you time back. Um, And then you&#x27;ve got Roland who has never worked a Saturday. And now we&#x27;re going to tell him I have to work Saturday.</p><p>Karen Lochhead: Well, to be fair, I can always work a Saturday and claim the time back. It&#x27;s not that, that is the sole reason. And if I said to Bob, I am going to work a Saturday. And I&#x27;m going to take the time back. You would be quite flexible about that, so I just don&#x27;t want to ruin it for anybody else. Yeah, but I also know,</p><p>Bob Duncan: I know, and my point here that I made to Alan is that. Is it yeah We can all see you&#x27;ll get the time back, But not one person has taken any time back from the last markets surgery we did. No Because you just have a time to do it.</p><p>Karen Lochhead: And the Saturday I worked out, didn&#x27;t really take time back either. Apart from the day, you said to me, just come in later.</p><p>Bob Duncan: Yeah. Anyway, I&#x27;m gonna get, I&#x27;m gonna let you go.</p><p>Karen Lochhead: None of us even take sick days by the way when we are sick. I know,</p><p>Bob Duncan: I know. But I&#x27;m gonna, I&#x27;m gonna let you go because I&#x27;ve got Jess here and and I&#x27;m trying to whip her into shape. Um.</p><p>Karen Lochhead: Hi Jess!</p><p>Bob Duncan: So, i&#x27;m gonna i&#x27;m gonna let you crack on okay? Bye!</p><p>Karen Lochhead: That&#x27;s gone wrong! You could be could be sacked for saying stuff like that by the way!</p><p>Bob Duncan: What? Whipping Jess into shape, she knows it. She knows it. Okay right? Right goodbye Bye.</p><p>Bob Duncan: Oh my gosh.</p></body></html>